wt/

# Speckit artifacts stay local: the implementation is what ships, and committing
# every design/spec/plan/tasks tree pollutes the repo. `wfctl archive-story`
# snapshots them to the XDG state dir at worktree teardown, so nothing is lost.
#
# This repo authors the skills that tell consumers specs are gitignored. Until
# now it was the one repo where that wasn't true, so its own pipeline runs
# behaved differently from every repo it ships to.
